# English report templates rendered by `report_text` in rust/src/seed/reports.rs (R379).
#
# Engine diagnostics, evidence labels, refusal reasons and execution notes
# that used to be typed into Rust as format strings. Each `{slot}` is filled
# by the caller in one pass; a missing record renders as its intent id, never
# as invented prose. They are English-only because the surfaces that print
# them (error paths, evidence-log labels, generated-file notes) are.
